&_nc_oc=AdpilWUIny9OuGzPkQ_xyKMuSLQJ2kYuww2aUTQ0C-yVEJzntW8IR9ozstG837hneUw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP-UqosG0YBL-cNkhFVbU2ES45kbTMVHTxUbg5W_dLnZg&oe=6ACCF9BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GFzk6_8JL4Q7kNvwH6NlbT&_nc_oc=AdoKUAm3lT9jNG5aD3ucW72mp3wm0tW384QmyT7lUMM6bw8s271Ma30uwbZOEv2AMT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPtanyAjlZurHbZxDxUxRJGyhnksJ6Gy6_1lMJUVpGA_w&oe=6ACD0ABC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DMiJk9RoHswQ7kNvwGMXX9Z&_nc_oc=Ado_G-UbZ7F1eiIphul2Uc5WaYjA4T1KxXY033rc_4vTGeFnGgihfjR0DI_cc25lxoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN634BdHfm1hwVtldlsYmoVDCrTkjQCvClNyNllpXS2oQ&oe=6ACCF107"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=18Vw_2YFmXoQ7kNvwEPtypA&_nc_oc=AdrreUSAe-KV3azzvOHMcpPcXGdBdAwENggmo4F-gfMIdOTTHAwHVy5Q6W9NP3P5KVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNCW1MRn2DvoTADbHRX5JjHaSxmwgAsTIWPpQhIFdsa4Q&oe=6ACD1515"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cBYWb_cstGkQ7kNvwHH84SP&_nc_oc=AdqhXsuveOiGYA8Fa0f7OSlq6YzxHQhzDb8G_bOEddj5ANtS93qTR2P_jOvJJGlyQDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMq5xyNY-t3c4i4iy4znkzxAOHONCvmLslHiEsh9ElDwg&oe=6ACCE964"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.